    "preferenceRetention": "Unknown JSON value spans retain literal large integers/nested values; material unknown fields follow actual stable ids. Known key spelling/format may be normalized.",
    "preferenceHandoff": "One actual namespace live owner spans model disposal until the issued Promise terminates. New instances cannot read/put/flush/recover concurrently; terminal Unknown transfers and needs explicit recovery.",
